<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Raspberry Pi Zero vs Bash Bunny</title>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff416c, #ff4b2b);
            color: white;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            padding: 50px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        .container:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin: 0;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Raspberry Pi Zero is better than Bash Bunny</h1>
        <p>Jé!</p>
